#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:5
#: 7bef7a6a7fa04a38882e94685bf0fdad
msgid "Leddar One Lidar"
msgstr "Leddar One 激光雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:7
#: bb1377b93d88414499f52071ac0764b5
msgid ""
"The `Leddar One Lidar <https://leddartech.com/modules/leddarone/>`__ is a "
"light weight and reasonably priced lidar with 40m range, 70hz update rate "
"and 3-degree diffuse beam.  For more details please refer to the `datasheet "
"<https://leddartech.com/app/uploads/dlm_uploads/2016/02/Datasheet-"
"LeddarOne.pdf>`__."
msgstr ""
"`Leddar One 激光雷达 <https://leddartech.com/modules/leddarone/>`__ "
"是一款轻量且价格合理的激光雷达，测距范围 40m，更新频率 70Hz，3 度漫反射光束。更多详情请参阅 `数据手册 "
"<https://leddartech.com/app/uploads/dlm_uploads/2016/02/Datasheet-"
"LeddarOne.pdf>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:13
#: 94131d5ca7cd46b0b13e576b9172964d
msgid "Connecting to the AutoPilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:15
#: 6be5e7b18a5040959fd571d87a33349d
msgid ""
"The sensor's serial connection can be connected to any spare serial port "
"(i.e. Telem1, Teleme2, Serial4) on the autopilot.  Connect the lidar's RX "
"line to the autopilot's UART TX line, the lidar's TX line to the UART's RX "
"then also connect the GND and 5V lines.  The image below shows how the "
"sensor output pins can be connected to a Pixhawk's Serial4 port."
msgstr ""
"传感器的串口连接可连接到飞控上任何空闲的串口（即 Telem1、Telem2、Serial4）。将激光雷达的 RX 线连接到飞控的 UART TX "
"线，将激光雷达的 TX 线连接到 UART 的 RX 线，同时连接 GND 和 5V 线。下图显示了如何将传感器输出引脚连接到 Pixhawk 的 "
"Serial4 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:20
#: def2182ade564c1f9f330335833606af
msgid ""
"You then need to setup the serial port and rangefinder parameters. If you "
"have used the SERIAL4/5 port on the Pixhawk then you would set the following"
" parameters for the first rangefinder (this is done on the Mission Planner's"
" **Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter List** page):"
msgstr ""
"然后需要设置串口和测距仪参数。如果使用 Pixhawk 上的 SERIAL4/5 端口，则应为第一个测距仪设置以下参数（在 Mission "
"Planner 的**配置/调参 \\| 完整参数列表**页面进行）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:25
#: 8a1497a06d5f4d86a524be8f37f85b9e
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:26
#: 65e436c7db71416aa761c681a35bb9a6
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 115200"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 115200"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:27
#: 3b217c3f6f30456fa84de6a8ca8eb3ad
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 12 (LeddarOne)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 12（LeddarOne）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:28
#: 1ca9f98a7d6e4ebb9eedb08b0c9f2489
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:29
#: f84cffea03344604951608bfa08478dc
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.05"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.05"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:30
#: b5c02a382bcf41da8590f4b511efc5d6
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = **40** (40m) *This is the distance in "
"meters that the rangefinder can reliably read.*"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = **40**（40m）*这是测距仪可以可靠读取的距离（米）。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:31
#: b99f9c1719ce4fc28159a110d88903ea
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 *or more accurately the "
"distance in metres from the range finder to the ground when the vehicle is "
"landed.  This value depends on how you have mounted the rangefinder.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 "
"*或更精确地，飞行器降落时测距仪到地面的距离（米）。该值取决于测距仪的安装方式。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:33
#: c114c11f1ee944eea90542ba0b66e8bc
msgid ""
"If you instead were using the Telem2 port on the Pixhawk then you would set "
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9, and :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD "
"<SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115200"
msgstr ""
"如果改用 Pixhawk 的 Telem2 端口，则应设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = "
"9，以及 :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115200"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:36
#: 5d66351bab1b40faa830bff5ab1ca4b8
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:38
#: 663e9115fcf6489496bcd73fb087e9a7
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请注意查找 「rangefinder1」。"
